WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en-GB

00:00:06.200 --> 00:00:10.690
Malcolm Grant: The next item on the Agenda
would have been the report of the committees,

00:00:10.690 --> 00:00:14.269
but we have taken those as starred items and
therefore we are not going to talk to them.

00:00:14.269 --> 00:00:16.720
That brings us to any other business.

00:00:16.720 --> 00:00:21.840
The only item that I have is that the next
meeting of the Board, which will be in London,

00:00:21.840 --> 00:00:23.680
will be on 23rd July.

00:00:23.680 --> 00:00:27.970
Is there any business anybody else would wish
to bring to the attention of the Board?

00:00:27.970 --> 00:00:30.110
If not, I declare the meeting closed.

00:00:30.110 --> 00:00:33.960
We will go into private session and pass the
normal resolution.

00:00:33.960 --> 00:00:36.090
Thank you all and thank you everybody for
joining us this morning.

